&s=7fc33f6a207d315812be71a2d2141ac9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Your artwork is very nice, and I would like you to draw my OC, I will leave the pose and background up to you. Thank you.\n\n※イラストはSNSへの掲載・YouTube&Twitch配信サムネイルでの利用を考えています\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1GIlznht2wJEcxf7oc27jNSWotmn2qXIB/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}